        "TileImage": "$($repository cb7b9923-0098-4336-8bff-6ca0d5d46440).Image",
        "Description": "Goodday 47,\r\rWe have been contacted by Interpol for a black bag operation. They have been involved in a year long undercover operation in China. Their agent has been discovered and the two men that know about them are attempting blackmail and extortion. If they are allowed to, this would destroy the operation and set Interpol back years of investigation. \r\rThey have requested that this be done silently and professionally. That means no non-targets can know you were there.\r\rHappy hunting 47",
